      "short": "Noncurrent",
      "taxonomy": "severity",
      "why": "Loans 90+ days past due as a share of all loans. Under 1% is low by historical standards; 1\u20132% is creeping; above 2% is elevated; 3%+ marks crisis territory \u2014 in the two decades of data shown it occurred only in the 2009\u20132013 aftermath (the early-1990s S&L era also ran that high).",
